        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "You go to bed on a summer night: there are no cars, no voices. But a noise from outside is keeping you up. It’s from a bug! It is so small, but so loud. Why is that?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Many loud bug noises you hear have to do with",
            "zh": "与……有关"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "mating",
            "zh": "交配"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The bugs need to make these noises, so they can be heard by other bugs. "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Male",
            "ref": "v-male"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "katydids",
            "zh": "纺织娘"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "rub",
            "zh": "摩擦"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their wings together to make a buzzing sound. This is their mating call."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "So do male "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "crickets",
            "zh": "蟋蟀"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "! They also rub their wings together to make noises. But their noises are better. They have different “calling songs”. A “soft song” "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "woos",
            "zh": "追求"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "female",
            "ref": "v-female"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " bugs; a “"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "rivalry",
            "zh": "竞争"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " song” "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "warns off",
            "zh": "告诫……远离"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " other male bugs."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Cicadas",
            "zh": "蝉"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " use noise-making "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "organs",
            "zh": "器官"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on their "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "abdomens",
            "zh": "腹部"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They are the loudest of the three bugs. When cicadas make noises, they "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "fold",
            "zh": "折叠"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "eardrums",
            "zh": "耳膜"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " closed. They do this to protect their own hearing. How clever they are!"
          }
        ]
      },
